{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:39 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:39 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:39 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"遭妻襲擊受傷男子送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9efe16e6181309daa2e3635ab05455d/2026-10/179332781755938.jpg\"/><p>油麻地彌敦道458號美景大廈，今（30日）早上7時37分，一對夫婦疑因離婚問題，在屋內發生激烈爭執，其間38歲妻子情緒激動，用玻璃樽扑打丈夫頭部，致其頭部流血紅腫，警員接報到場，經調查後拘捕妻子涉襲擊他人造成身體傷害，丈夫則清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:00:02.687246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:39:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:21:06.459996+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:17.485561+00:00","content_hash":"a1a8cd84bd1d1d3634cc10c2b83923b3b6befed29d0cacb9a77fc618e13877e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}